{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0414_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0414_story_06_title", "source_sha256": "5e3c43f334970ebffe9cc514763afd0266adbf00cb800b105bf0111a2a11fdc9", "ja": "Angel対決公演、開演！", "zh": "Angel对决公演，开演！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0414_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0414_story_06_synopsis", "source_sha256": "d22f737cb5432716c8a384f9b57f025c11fc28c3519047f754422da4fe47c3d6", "ja": "公演当日。なんだか途中の記憶が曖昧な気が\nするものの、アイドルたちの気合いは十分。\nだって仲間兼ライバルがいつも一緒だから。\nそれに、誰かに見守られている気もするし。\n明るく元気に、彼女たちは舞台に向かう。", "zh": "演出当天。总觉得中途的记忆有些模糊，\n不过，偶像们的干劲十足。\n因为伙伴兼对手总是陪在身边。\n而且，也感觉像是有人一直在守护着她们。\n她们精神饱满地走向舞台。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0414_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0414_story_06_1000_null", "source_sha256": "306317bac395df262a760078b0f8b1eedb350faf120f9a5e2d7c33f7859bd4a4", "ja": "Angel [charming]対Angel [sweetie]\n公演当日……", "zh": "Angel [charming]对Angel [sweetie]\n公演当天……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0414_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0414_story_06_1001_p", "source_sha256": "1a1dbabb8602acb15822c43b342f095b565da893d14599542b20f1565c15fffc", "ja": "（どうにか公演までこぎつけた。\nなんだか、途中の記憶が曖昧だけど……）", "zh": "（总算赶上了公演。\n不过，总觉得中途的记忆有些模糊……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0414_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0414_story_06_1002_041fuk", "source_sha256": "20dabeb4d0bbf95cbdcb3bd0a44afb67581664e75fee1c364642642d52c54e67", "ja": "いよいよ開演ですね。\nうぅ……何度やっても、この瞬間は緊張するなぁ。", "zh": "终于要开演了呢。\n呜……不管演过多少次，每到这一刻还是会紧张啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0414_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0414_story_06_1003_012mam", "source_sha256": "7d1a0de36a78a4c416f46f55df1e8af2c16a6b79dc07465bc69cda155f08c03d", "ja": "うーん……うぅーん……？", "zh": "嗯……呜嗯……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0414_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0414_story_06_1004_039kon", "source_sha256": "2552e7a82b852734775f8cc77391e4e33dead1c468dfb7553cadf96aaa78748b", "ja": "あら？　真美ちゃん、どうしたの？\n眉間にシワがよっちゃってるわよ？", "zh": "咦？真美，你怎么了？\n眉头都皱起来了哦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0414_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0414_story_06_1005_012mam", "source_sha256": "5f2e9cb9c5613d33f87b2c53be92f3ef4645a4e6d57e9b1ec4bec43d2854fc53", "ja": "今回のメンバーって、この6人だけだっけ？\nなんか、もうひとりいたような……？", "zh": "这次的成员只有这6个人吗？总觉得好像还有另一个人……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0414_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0414_story_06_1006_010azu", "source_sha256": "d95be204201d6bd3712c1141baea2ee8935d8a41ab219a08b52dcee15495548b", "ja": "6人で合ってると思うけど……でも、\n言われてみると、足りない気もするわね～。", "zh": "我觉得应该是6个人没错……不过，\n被你这么一说，好像确实觉得少了谁呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0414_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0414_story_06_1007_048rei", "source_sha256": "bc844c9fa0742c5055b772be22db722168c947d02d89bab1b35fe5099c49d52c", "ja": "そうかも？　でもでも、きっと近くで\n観てるんじゃないかな！　ふふっ♪", "zh": "也许吧？不过不过，说不定就在附近看着呢！呵呵♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0414_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0414_story_06_1008_p", "source_sha256": "c1971044cde2d32e4bb115a4887aa3b838f49e392d32985f4da9671614fa1c79", "ja": "おっと……そろそろ開演だ。\nみんな準備はいいか？", "zh": "等等……差不多要开演了。\n大家准备好了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0414_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0414_story_06_1009_041fuk", "source_sha256": "18cd20906318e493918e58be947b380cbc4de14981955330a905445f833bc37d", "ja": "いけない、そうでしたね！\n集中、集中！", "zh": "糟糕，确实是这样！\n集中精神，集中精神！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0414_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0414_story_06_1010_010azu", "source_sha256": "6aa61f26935f6cd4c142d4016401de51f4547a9542a6058298006bd88f446671", "ja": "今日のステージは、全員がライバルですからね。\n私も、負けないように頑張らなくちゃ。", "zh": "今天的舞台上，大家都是竞争对手呢。\n我也得努力，不能输给大家。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0414_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0414_story_06_1011_018ele", "source_sha256": "b55fd90eb328696931cb553bc59059fd1cf17a28a7245031c8e9b2e9c8e4407c", "ja": "本気で戦えるライバルがいっぱいいてくれて、\nワタシはすーーーっごく嬉しいヨ！", "zh": "有这么多能认真较量的对手在，我真的超——级开心哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0414_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0414_story_06_1012_041fuk", "source_sha256": "f9c2174f1d4f849371df12605ab187e465faf03c9d6c30eab2384ca5772e4564", "ja": "うん。私も、すごくドキドキしてる……。\n今日は思いっきり、頑張るね！", "zh": "嗯。我也非常紧张……\n今天我会全力以赴的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0414_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0414_story_06_1013_039kon", "source_sha256": "7bb24fa602ce9f6221f3659ec0f4135ac816f8491de7e71e74075ebb4368d2d5", "ja": "考えてみたら、私たちって幸せよね。\n仲間とライバルが、すぐ傍にいるんだもの。", "zh": "仔细想想，我们还真是幸福呢。伙伴和对手都在身边嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0414_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0414_story_06_1014_048rei", "source_sha256": "14337bdfea316ebdaddb3d4a5ec7421e2fe065e565b73ac911294dac024d5843", "ja": "たしかに！\nそれって、とっても素敵なことですよね♪", "zh": "确实！\n那真的是一件非常美好的事呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0414_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0414_story_06_1015_p", "source_sha256": "d6f561bbcf0d59f622921393faa7a896a32dda34ca42c20ca1f718aa86a6c449", "ja": "そうだな。今日はそれを、みんなに見せに行こう。\n会場や配信で観てくれるお客さん……。", "zh": "是啊。今天就去把这个展现给大家吧。\n在会场或通过直播观看的观众……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0414_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0414_story_06_1016_p", "source_sha256": "9ba715858c87096bac065f01bebc33171e68db08f15fed968460a64969ea1cc6", "ja": "それから……いつも見守ってくれている、誰かにも！", "zh": "还有……也要给一直守望着我们的某个人看看！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0414_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0414_story_06_1017_012mam", "source_sha256": "62ed24f486c63dc288364bd271dce38c804ea5de12e44f4bb474b85a599143e8", "ja": "？　兄ちゃん、誰かって誰？", "zh": "？哥哥，你说的那个人是谁？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0414_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0414_story_06_1018_p", "source_sha256": "7fba89491a0c3b0ac9f0697a91a79c36b946aba076c052568ba042292eed0e33", "ja": "ん？　それは……あれ、誰だっけな。", "zh": "嗯？这个嘛……咦，来着谁呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0414_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0414_story_06_1019_018ele", "source_sha256": "f903e419fdd38266a4897816de9b832b83ee12932b5450a63c55dd780fd41bc6", "ja": "つまり……ワタシたちを大好きな人が、\n世界中にたくさんいるってコトかも！", "zh": "也就是说……喜欢我们的人，或许遍布全世界！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0414_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0414_story_06_1020_012mam", "source_sha256": "33367fafd0b58a292cac4337f67792b833936c5570afe663d3e725dc0de0fc47", "ja": "なるほど～。\nそれなら、真美も納得だよ！", "zh": "原来如此～。\n这样的话，真美也就明白了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0414_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0414_story_06_1021_041fuk", "source_sha256": "8923ec4f782deabf983ec79f152074e4820542eb1f484b0ad810dc4309f22dab", "ja": "応援してくれるみなさんに、恥ずかしくないように……\n{$P$}さん、行ってきますね！", "zh": "为了不辜负支持我们的各位……\n{$P$}先生，那我出发了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0414_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0414_story_06_1022_p", "source_sha256": "d50d3d40370cc8403bd1ef21657f9e616fe8827fb96573dd6c6ea658b52e0a29", "ja": "（走っていくみんなの背中を、スポットライトが\n照らし出す。その光は、いつも以上に煌めいて見えた）", "zh": "（聚光灯照亮了大家奔跑而去的背影。那道光看起来比平时更加璀璨耀眼）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0414_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0414_story_06_1023_p", "source_sha256": "82e971241ac5ee387a954fe11b2719fc6a093f79fe1de7e19ed44317f9ecc6ae", "ja": "（きっと、忘れられないステージになる……\n今回も、いつものステージと同じように！）", "zh": "（这一定会成为令人难忘的舞台……这次也会和往常一样！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
